{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "h3_root_20261006",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -600,
      "y": -500,
      "width": 4100,
      "height": 3600,
      "color": "6",
      "label": "H3 视频生产问题系统｜详细问题、门禁、证据与下一步"
    },
    {
      "id": "h3_title_20261006",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# H3 视频生产问题系统｜2026-10-06\\n\\n来源：黎黎隆问题系统.canvas（1.0-2026-10-06-character-h3-alignment）\\n职责：收拢 H3 / LongTake 的详细问题、输入门禁、实战经验、资产追溯与状态。\\n总览保留 MAIN-03 / 10 / 15 / 20 索引；详细内容以本 Canvas 为准。",
      "x": 400,
      "y": -350,
      "width": 1900,
      "height": 420,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "g5",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "G5｜H3 / 视频生产稳定\n\nIMG-SMOKE-01：PASS\n已验证最小链：Codex imagegen → PNG → SHA256 → Linear attachment\n注意：仅证明测试链路可用，不代表正式批量 / H3 成片已解锁",
      "x": -350,
      "y": -300,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "m10_c2d1e8f3",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# MAIN-10｜H3/LongTake：10–11s → 长连续生产\\n\\n状态：PARTIAL｜R1 DONE → R2 ACTIVE → R3 CLOSE\\nH04：257 PASS + 258 READY_FOR_H3\\n4层：L1=1根问题｜L2=4问题簇｜L3=14 SUB｜L4=7当前实验未知\\n硬里程碑：短块稳定 → 30s LongTake → 60s\\n知识：[[L1-L4问题知识/MAIN-10|知识卡]]",
      "x": -350,
      "y": 180,
      "width": 850,
      "height": 470,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "h3_stack_20261006",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# H3 当前问题栈｜2026-10-06\\n\\nR1 DONE：证据去重/失效实验剔除\\nR2 ACTIVE：7 个真实未知最小矩阵\\nR3 PLANNED：复验 + 4份协议冻结\\n\\nL2 四簇：\\n① 输入/职责 3 SUB\\n② 短块稳定 4 SUB\\n③ 调度/审核 4 SUB\\n④ LongTake 3 SUB\\n\\n当前关键缺口：H04 场景资产、动作/镜头边界、CBEC A/B、30s/60s、4080硬件边界",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 180,
      "width": 1150,
      "height": 700,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "charh3align20261006",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 角色 Agent → H3 对齐门\n\n发现：角色认知与四宫格没有统一交接，导致“文字是这个人、四宫格却漂了”仍能进视频。\n\n现行门禁：\n1. 素材 Agent 核真图/path/SHA\n2. 角色 Agent 核 identity_core / world_role / age / body / costume / special structures\n3. 四宫格 TL/TR/BL/BR 逐格核 identity/cognition/proportion/costume\n4. AG-06 核静态视觉\n5. 输出 CHARACTER_H3_READY_PACKET\n6. 只有 READY_FOR_H3 才给 AG-07\n\n一格核心错，不允许三格平均；H3 不负责“融合正确角色”。",
      "x": -350,
      "y": 920,
      "width": 1200,
      "height": 760,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "h3exp20261006",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# H3｜4090 实战经验 → 4080 代理门禁\n\n已吸收：\n• /history 为运行时权威\n• failed 先读 error body\n• WRITTEN ≠ RENDERING\n• 文件出现 ≠ 完成\n• 真素材必须真绑定\n• 崩源卡禁止无限重跑\n\n迁移基线：单实例、10–11s优先、>264f不直接批跑\n但以上硬件量必须在4080重新认证。\n\n新增输入门：\nHEADSHOT 只锁身份；中景/全身需相应视图；永久禁止非等比 stretch；PLAN_PACKET + input_preflight PASS 后才渲染。",
      "x": 950,
      "y": 920,
      "width": 1050,
      "height": 720,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "d9e8f5a0b4c31276",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# R3｜唯一 Q 增量候选\\n\\nQ-ASSET-001：H3 参考资产的 ID / 路径 / SHA / 实际消费链仍需复验。\\n状态：候选增量，原 Q 保持 OPEN；不新建平行素材引用问题。\\n下一步：读取当前任务 JSON、workflow 和真实 receipt 后再决定是否写回。",
      "x": 2150,
      "y": 920,
      "width": 1150,
      "height": 500,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "h3_refs_20261006",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 总览中的关联问题\\n\\nMAIN-03｜头像→中景/中全景/全身角色一致性\\nH3关联：角色认知×四宫格逐格对齐门。\\n\\nMAIN-15｜角色/世界观/场景/镜头统一生产链\\nH3关联：CHARACTER_RECHECK → H3_PLAN → H3_RENDER。\\n\\nMAIN-20｜本地 4080 32GB / ComfyUI / H3 生产底座\\nH3关联：4080 硬件边界需要重新认证。\\n\\n知识卡：[[L1-L4问题知识/MAIN-03|MAIN-03]] · [[L1-L4问题知识/MAIN-10|MAIN-10]] · [[L1-L4问题知识/MAIN-15|MAIN-15]] · [[L1-L4问题知识/MAIN-20|MAIN-20]]",
      "x": 2150,
      "y": 180,
      "width": 1150,
      "height": 650,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "h3_method_20261006",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 当前采用的生产顺序\\n\\n先锁角色、场景和资产输入，再进入 H3 / 长镜验证。\\nH3 只消费 READY_FOR_H3 角色包；每次运行以任务 JSON、workflow、真实 receipt 与实际文件为证据。",
      "x": -350,
      "y": 1750,
      "width": 1250,
      "height": 430,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "h3_problem_system_group_20261007",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 3600,
      "y": -500,
      "width": 4200,
      "height": 3600,
      "color": "4",
      "label": "AG-07 H3代理｜知识全部问题系统化"
    },
    {
      "id": "z_h3_root_20261007",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Z-H3｜H3总目标\n\nREADY_FOR_H3 → 可追溯、可复验、可连续拼接的视频生产。\n\nAG-07 不保留平行私有知识；所有知识进入 XN / NX / PATH / EVIDENCE。\n\nAgent正本：[[../20_Agent系统/01_Agent库/AG-07_H3渲染Agent.md]]\n总问题：[[黎黎隆问题系统.canvas]]",
      "x": 3800,
      "y": -320,
      "width": 1200,
      "height": 520,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "z_h3_cluster_a_20261007",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## H3 子Z｜输入与短块\nZ-H3-01 INPUT｜输入/职责匹配\nZ-H3-02 SHORTBLOCK｜10–11s稳定\nZ-H3-03 ACTION｜动作复杂度边界\nZ-H3-04 CAMERA｜镜头运动边界\nZ-H3-05 BINDING｜角色×场景职责",
      "x": 3800,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 1150,
      "height": 620,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "z_h3_cluster_b_20261007",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## H3 子Z｜结构与连续性\nZ-H3-06 ENCODING｜Flat/CBEC/动态链编码\nZ-H3-07 SEED｜多seed鲁棒性\nZ-H3-08 LONGTAKE｜10–11s→30s→60s\nZ-H3-09 RUNTIME｜4080/ComfyUI现实能力\nZ-H3-10 REVIEW｜审核/重试/receipt",
      "x": 5100,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 1150,
      "height": 620,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "h3_xn_system_20261007",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## XN_RECORD｜规则\n\n每条 H3 规则必须记录：\nxn_id / supports_z / statement / source_type / evidence_ref / expected_fit / verified_fit / status\n\n已知候选：\n• HEADSHOT→IDENTITY_ONLY\n• 禁非等比 stretch\n• READY_FOR_H3 前置\n• WRITTEN≠RENDERING\n• 文件出现≠完成\n• 执行重试≤2\n\n迁移经验未经4080复验不得 VERIFIED。",
      "x": 3800,
      "y": 1120,
      "width": 1150,
      "height": 820,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "h3_nx_system_20261007",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## NX_GAP｜待实验\n\n• 10s vs 11s真实稳定差\n• 264f边界\n• 动作复杂度阈值\n• 镜头运动安全级\n• 双参考是否最小充分\n• CBEC vs Flat\n• seed数量规则\n• LongTake状态字段\n• 运动中“角色味道”可否机械审\n\nNX → 实验 → evidence → candidate XN → verified/rejected",
      "x": 5100,
      "y": 1120,
      "width": 1150,
      "height": 820,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "h3_path_system_20261007",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## PATH_STATE｜现实能力\n\n4080_local_32g\nComfyUI / H3 workflow\n模型/节点/Sage\nVRAM/RAM/耗时\nwatcher/queue/executor\nLinear附件读取\n视频/关键帧/SHA回传\n抽帧审核链\n\nFOUND→ACQUIRED→READABLE→UNDERSTOOD→ADAPTED→EXECUTABLE→AUTOMATABLE→VERIFIED",
      "x": 6400,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 1150,
      "height": 800,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "h3_evidence_system_20261007",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## EVIDENCE｜只认真实证据\n\ntask JSON / workflow\n/history + error body\ninput SHA / output SHA\n实际视频\nhead/mid/tail / 抽帧\nruntime / VRAM / RAM\n机械审核 + 74审核\n\n知识状态：RAW_OBSERVATION → NX → CANDIDATE_XN → TESTING → VERIFIED_XN / REJECTED / DEPRECATED",
      "x": 6400,
      "y": 1250,
      "width": 1150,
      "height": 740,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "h3_authority_oop_20261007",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# AUTHORITY｜人在环外默认\n\nAUTO_CONTINUE=true\n\nAG-07/问题系统可自主：选子Z → 最小实验 → preflight → RENDER_TASK → receipt → evidence → XN/NX/PATH校准 → NEXT。\n\n只把以下升级给74：\n• 审美/角色味道\n• 新Canon/身份冲突\n• 用户确认冲突\n• 高风险不可逆\n• 购买/登录/授权\n• NX长期不收敛\n\n局部 USER_REVIEW 不阻塞其他分支。\n\n每轮必须结束为：CYCLE_DONE / NO_OP / WAIT_RUNTIME_TEST / WAIT_ASSET / USER_REVIEW / BLOCKED",
      "x": 6400,
      "y": 2150,
      "width": 1150,
      "height": 760,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "h3_to_282_feedback_20261007",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# H3 → 282 反向证据回流\n\nH3 的 identity/body/costume 漂移、失败族、关键帧审核不能只留在视频域。\n\n回流：\nH3 EVIDENCE\n→ 对应 Z-ROLE-L1/L2/L3\n→ 282 Z5 candidate XN / NX\n→ Z6 Base / asset state\n→ 新Z或修订 READY_FOR_H3 包\n\n这样 H3 会反向教角色系统，而不是每次只改 prompt。",
      "x": 3800,
      "y": 2200,
      "width": 1150,
      "height": 700,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "moved_to_b_canvas_20261007",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -350,
      "y": 2350,
      "width": 3650,
      "height": 520,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "# CANONICAL MOVED｜B端问题系统.canvas\n\n本 Canvas 自 2026-10-07 起降级为 H3 历史/导航视图；B端、AG-07、H3问题、B1–B4、READY_FOR_H3、A/C反馈的详细正本统一迁移至 [[B端问题系统.canvas]]。\n\n后续状态更新优先写 B端问题系统.canvas；本图只保留历史节点与导航，禁止再发展平行详细问题树。"
    }
  ],
